    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is Vault?</h1>",
     "id": "88_27616",
     "aream": "1/2/4/10",
     "aread": "3/2/6/26",
     "zm": "2",
     "zd": "2",
     "jm": "flex-start",
     "jd": "flex-start",
     "am": "flex-start",
     "ad": "flex-start"
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "alt": "",
     "src": "/sq/img/site/vault-kids-cbc3df.jpg",
     "orig": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66a3d846ea485f2b0bc205ad/a5342fa3-33bc-45dd-91a3-e951753f4d43/vault-kids.jpg",
     "w": 3284,
     "h": 1166,
     "fit": "contain",
     "id": "88_24721",
     "aream": "4/2/10/10",
     "aread": "6/1/19/27",
     "zm": "1",
     "zd": "1",
     "jm": "center",
     "jd": "center",
     "am": "center",
     "ad": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Millions of dollars are invested in making learning games every year but many of these gems are lost in a sea of online  junk.&nbsp; Our mission is to provide a dedicated home for these games – a Vault.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Inspired by the success of initiatives like <a href=\"https://pbskids.org/games\" target=\"_blank\">PBS KIDS</a>, which has become an essential resource for young learners, the Vault fills a critical gap by focusing on formal learning in grades 3 and up.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We’ve curated these games to ensure they’re effective, engaging, and compatible with the <em>chromebooks</em> and tools already common in classrooms. We're building a collaborative community, curated by the nerds at <a href=\"https://fielddaylab.wisc.edu\" target=\"_blank\">Field Day Lab.</a></p>",
     "id": "88_50795",
     "aream": "10/2/27/10",
     "aread": "20/5/30/23",
     "zm": "3",
     "zd": "3",
     "jm": "flex-start",
     "jd": "flex-start",
     "am": "flex-start",
     "ad": "flex-start"
    },
    {
     "type": "button",
     "label": "Join Vault",
