    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Why are we doing it? </h2>",
     "id": "2f613012",
     "aream": "20/2/22/10",
     "aread": "11/3/14/12",
     "zm": "1",
     "zd": "1",
     "jm": "flex-start",
     "jd": "flex-start",
     "am": "flex-start",
     "ad": "flex-start"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Teaching is challenging. Teachers who want to use games often have a really hard time finding good ones. </p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our goal is to simplify that search. We have worked with teachers for over a decade to learn what works and what doesn’t.</p>",
     "id": "8acea0d0",
     "aream": "22/2/29/10",
     "aread": "14/3/22/12",
     "zm": "5",
     "zd": "5",
     "jm": "flex-start",
     "jd": "flex-start",
     "am": "flex-start",
     "ad": "flex-start"
    },
