     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Talk about The Vault with teachers at your local school, regional conferences, or anywhere educators gather.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xc24kJD_8X49THiTebm0ogBWf5Se-CQN?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Download</strong> <strong>images here</strong></a> to share online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Social Tags</strong>: #TheVaultGames, and tag us @fielddaylab</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Social Copy</strong>: “Discover The Vault! Your destination for high-quality educational games designed for grade 4+ classrooms. Free, curated, and teacher-friendly. #TheVaultGames @fielddaylab”</p>",
